  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GPI: Life-Cycle Cost Analysis Curriculum Platform Maintenance and Supp. Training, through Supply Chain Vision, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity funds a sole-source contract for Supply Chain Vision, Inc. to continue to host and maintain the Life Cycle Cost Analysis (LCCA) web-based course developed under a previous contract. The Contractor will be responsible for hosting and maintaining the online course and applying necessary changes to the curriculum for a period of one year plus four option years, if exercised. The LCCA web-based course is utilized to train procurement practitioners in value-based procurement methods under the Global Procurement Initiative: Understanding Best Value (GPI).</narrative>
  </description>
